# Guardrail fixture — removed API instructed from YAML, not Markdown
# dead-api used to scan only *.md, so the inherited issue templates kept telling
# people to export a flag that no longer exists. This fixture keeps that gap closed.
name: Fixture
body:
  - type: input
    attributes:
      label: Reproduction
      description: Run TeamCreate(team_name "x") and paste the output here.
